  "title": "Skyward Specialty to Host Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Call Wednesday, August 5, 2026 - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Houston, TX – July 2, 2026 – Skyward Specialty Insurance Group, Inc.TM (NASDAQ: SKWD) (\"Skyward Group\" or \"the Company\") expects to issue its second quarter 2026 earnings results, inclusive of Apollo Group Holdings Ltd., after the market closes on Tuesday, August 4 which will be available on the Company website at investors.skywardinsurance.com/ under Quarterly Results.",
